<Layout title="Terms" description="Terms for Virgil Digital website projects and enquiries.">
  <span class="kicker">Terms</span>
  <h1>Working <span class="accent">together.</span></h1>
  <p class="lede">The practical terms that guide a Virgil Digital project.</p>
  <h2>Scope and price</h2>
  <p>Each project is agreed before work starts, including the pages, content, integrations, revisions, price and payment schedule. Published prices are starting points and may change when the scope changes.</p>
  <h2>Your content and approvals</h2>
  <p>You provide accurate text, images, branding and business information that you have permission to use. You are responsible for checking content, links, contact details and legal compliance before launch.</p>
  <h2>Hosting and third parties</h2>
  <p>Websites may use Cloudflare, domain registrars, email providers and other third-party services. Their availability and terms are outside Virgil Digital's control.</p>
  <h2>Support</h2>
  <p>Care, updates and ongoing support are included only where stated in the written project agreement. A launch does not guarantee search rankings, enquiries or a particular business result.</p>
  <p><small>Last updated: 23 October 2026. This is general information, not legal advice.</small></p>
</Layout>
